{"seq":1,"slug":"dynamic-pricing-rule-quantity-ladder","title":"动态定价引擎：基础价、选项加价与阶梯/成本加成模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-customization-cpq-configurator-made-to-order/dynamic-pricing-pod-fulfillment-ops/dynamic-pricing-rule-quantity-ladder","wordCount":2976,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"动态定价引擎-基础价-选项加价与阶梯-成本加成模型\">动态定价引擎：基础价、选项加价与阶梯/成本加成模型</h1><p>一件定制马克杯，同一条 Listing 下会同时存在至少六种价格：白色杯体的基础价、换陶瓷内胆的加价、双面印花的加价、印满整圈的加价、买 24 只时的每只阶梯价、发往德国含 VAT 的落地价。用户看到的只是最后那个数字，工程上却必须能随时把它拆回这六个分量。动态定价引擎要解决的正是这件事：把「价格」从商品记录里的一个固定字段，变成<strong>可由配置向量与上下文确定性重算的函数</strong>。它是本 hub 主数据建模的收口环节——<code>../1_customization-model-option-variants/3_configurable-product-catalog-data-model.md</code> 定义产品、BOM 与选项到物料的映射，<code>../2_constraint-rules-cpq-guided-selling/1_constraint-rule-engine-architecture.md</code> 定义合法配置的求解；本文讨论的是：一个合法配置值多少钱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-四类价格分量与各自的真相源\">核心概念：四类价格分量与各自的真相源</h2><p>把基础价和选项加价拍平成一张变体价格表，是配置器定价的第一个常见错误，因为二者的<strong>变更频率与作用域</strong>完全不同。价格由四层分量构成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基础价（base price）</strong>：父产品本身的价格，作用域是整个父产品。</li>\n<li><strong>选项加价（option surcharge）</strong>：某选项取值带来的增量，作用域是「父产品 × 选项取值」。同款卫衣「加绒」加价 40 元、针织衫上可能只加 25 元，因此加价须挂在「产品/物料」维度。</li>\n<li><strong>阶梯价（quantity break）</strong>：达到某购买数量后的单价或折扣，作用域是「变体 × 数量区间」。</li>\n<li><strong>履约与落地附加</strong>：加工费、运费、税费及区域换算，作用域是「变体 × 目的国 × 渠道」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>四层分开的价值在于<strong>重算范围可控</strong>：改基础价只需重算一个父产品，改某选项加价只需重算含该取值的组合，改某市场税费规则只需重算该市场。若压成一条变体价格记录，任何改动都要全量重刷。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分量</th>\n<th>真相源</th>\n<th>变更频率</th>\n<th>重算范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础价</td>\n<td>父产品记录</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>整个父产品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选项加价</td>\n<td>物料/选项映射</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>含该取值的配置子集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阶梯价</td>\n<td>价格表 / 价目表规则</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>变体 × 数量区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>履约与税费</td>\n<td>履约方费率 + 税务规则</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>变体 × 市场</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这也是为什么<strong>选项加价不该写进变体表</strong>：只作为工序存在的装饰选项不产生独立 SKU，却仍需加价，它只能作为「行项目属性对应的独立价格行」存在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"价格解析管线-确定性-可重放-可解释\">价格解析管线：确定性、可重放、可解释</h2><p>价格引擎的核心契约不是「算出多少钱」，而是<strong>同一输入永远得到同一输出，且每一步可回溯</strong>。把定价写成一条有向解析管线，输入是「配置向量 + 数量 + 上下文 + 市场」，输出是一个价格对象（含各分量明细）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[配置向量 + 数量 + 上下文] --&gt; B[基础价 Base Price]&#10;  B --&gt; C[选项加价累加]&#10;  C --&gt; D[价目表规则&lt;br/&gt;折扣 → 四舍五入 → 附加费]&#10;  D --&gt; E{是否跨越阶梯阈值}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| F[单价 × 数量]&#10;  E --&gt;|是| G[取对应区间每单位价 × 数量]&#10;  F --&gt; H[履约与落地成本&lt;br/&gt;fulfillment + tax]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[价格对象 + 明细快照&lt;br/&gt;Quote Snapshot]\">graph TD\n  A[配置向量 + 数量 + 上下文] --&gt; B[基础价 Base Price]\n  B --&gt; C[选项加价累加]\n  C --&gt; D[价目表规则&lt;br/&gt;折扣 → 四舍五入 → 附加费]\n  D --&gt; E{是否跨越阶梯阈值}\n  E --&gt;|否| F[单价 × 数量]\n  E --&gt;|是| G[取对应区间每单位价 × 数量]\n  F --&gt; H[履约与落地成本&lt;br/&gt;fulfillment + tax]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[价格对象 + 明细快照&lt;br/&gt;Quote Snapshot]</pre><p>管线顺序不能任意调换。Odoo 18 的价目表规则规定：Formula 类型的顺序是<strong>先折扣、再四舍五入、最后附加费</strong>（来源：Odoo 18 Documentation，<em>Pricelists</em>）。顺序有实际后果——先舍入再加附加费，最终价会落在非整数分上；顺序颠倒，<code>.99</code> 结尾的定价技巧就会失效（Odoo 经典组合是 20% 折扣 + 四舍五入到 10 + 附加费 -0.01）。另一个易忽略的差异是：<strong>Formula 折扣对客户不可见，Discount 折扣对客户可见</strong>（来源同上）——选项加价多是成本传导，用 Formula 做隐性加价、用 Discount 做显性促销。</p>\n<p>舍入本身也要建模成规则。Shopify 本地化定价允许按市场自定义舍入，文档列出的选项为「向上取整到最近的某个数值」（来源：Shopify Help Center，<em>Rounding prices</em>）。多币种场景下，舍入必须发生在<strong>换汇之后</strong>，否则同一商品在不同市场的价格会出现非单调跳变。</p>\n<p>价格解析的第三个契约是<strong>可解释性</strong>：价格对象必须携带明细（基础价、各加价项、折扣、舍入差、税费），因为售后争议、发票与税务申报都要还原计算过程。这决定了报价必须落为<strong>快照</strong>（见 <code>../2_constraint-rules-cpq-guided-selling/3_rule-versioning-conflict-testing.md</code>），即「下单时刻的明细与规则版本一起冻结」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阶梯定价-数量断点的定义与边界\">阶梯定价：数量断点的定义与边界</h2><p>数量阶梯不是「买多便宜」的营销文案，而是一组有明确约束的价格区间，边界写错就会产生「越买越贵」的漏洞。阶梯价有两种表达：<strong>每单位价（unit price）<strong>与</strong>折扣率（percentage off）</strong>。Adobe Commerce 的 tier price 明确定义为<strong>折扣后的单件价格</strong>而非整单总价，可用 Fixed（固定金额）或 Discount（从基础 Price 字段计算的百分比），百分比折扣的基数是 <strong>Price 字段而非 Special Price</strong>（来源：Adobe Commerce Admin，<em>Tier pricing</em>）。「折扣基数是谁」极易出错：促销价与阶梯价同时存在时，基数选错会让两层折扣叠乘，最终价低于成本。</p>\n<p>平台对阶梯数量的硬约束必须建模进区间校验。Shopify B2B 数量定价给出几条可直接照搬的规则（来源：Shopify Help Center，<em>B2B quantity pricing</em>）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>每个产品最多 10 个价格断点，断点作用于每个变体</strong>；</li>\n<li>数量规则存在于<strong>变体级别</strong>，不同变体的数量<strong>不能合并</strong>以达成门槛；</li>\n<li>断点数量必须<strong>高于最小订购量</strong>且<strong>能被数量增量整除</strong>；</li>\n<li>官方示例区间为 1 件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mtext>、</mtext><mn>20</mn><mtext>件</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20、20 件</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、</span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">件</span></span></span></span></span>18.50、50 件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>17.75</mn><mtext>、</mtext><mn>100</mn><mtext>件</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">17.75、100 件</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">17.75</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、</span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">件</span></span></span></span></span>16；</li>\n<li>一旦使用数量定价，<strong>价格被固定，目录级别的整体折扣不再生效</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>数量规则的 API 形状值得照抄：Shopify 的 <code>QuantityRule</code> 字段为 <code>minimum</code>、<code>maximum</code>、<code>increment</code>，断点对象 <code>QuantityPriceBreak</code> 只含 <code>minimumQuantity</code> 与 <code>price</code>（MoneyV2）（来源：Shopify Admin GraphQL API，<em>QuantityRule</em> / <em>QuantityPriceBreak</em>）。它把「能买多少」与「买多少便宜」拆成两个正交对象。</p>\n<p>阶梯的数学表达是分段函数。设断点为有序集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{(q_k, p_k)\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 递增：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>unit</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>其中</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>i</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{unit}}(q) = p_k \\quad \\text{其中} \\quad k = \\max\\{\\, i \\mid q \\ge q_i \\,\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">其中</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实现必须保证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> <strong>单调不增</strong>（防止「越买越贵」），且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 严格递增（防止区间重叠），这两条应作为价格规则发布时的<strong>校验门</strong>。按需制造还有一个约束：<strong>阶梯不能低于 POD 履约成本</strong>。Printify 的典型数字是：一件 Unisex Jersey 短袖 T 恤含一次印花的履约成本为 <strong>$8.77</strong>（不含运费、税费与其他店铺开支，来源：Printify 官网定价页，2026）。因此阶梯价的下界是「履约成本 + 最低毛利」，且须按变体单独校验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本加成模型-按需制造下的价格下限\">成本加成模型：按需制造下的价格下限</h2><p>定制商品的价格不能只从「竞品卖多少」倒推，因为每笔定制订单都对应一笔真实且随配置变化的履约成本。成本加成把履约成本拆成<strong>与配置相关的分量</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fulfill</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>blank</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>decoration</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>print</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>ship</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>pack</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fulfill}}(c) = C_{\\text{blank}} + \\sum_{j \\in \\text{decoration}(c)} C_{\\text{print}}(j) + C_{\\text{ship}}(c) + C_{\\text{pack}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fulfill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">blank</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">decoration</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">print</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span>